# Agent folder — may hold credentials or auth tokens (spec-kit's own advice).
# The speckit skills live here and are regenerated by `specify init`.
#
# Note the `.claude/*` form rather than `.claude/`: git cannot re-include a file
# whose parent directory is excluded, and settings.json below is a deliberate
# exception — it is the checked-in example that declares this marketplace to
# anyone who opens the repo. See docs/team-setup.md.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Logs / scratch
*.log
tmp/
